    [Cherry-pick][releases/v0.30.0][CI][Test] Update Qwen3.6 310P test configurations (from #18273) (#18274)
    
    Cherry-pick of PR #18273 onto `releases/v0.30.0`.
    
    Original PR: #18273
    Original author: @czydyy
    
    ---
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Backports the Qwen3.6 310P test configuration changes from #18000 to
    main. It removes unused sampling parameters from the 27B DUO and 35B MTP
    cases and updates the 27B and 35B DUO performance baselines. GLM changes
    from #18000 are excluded.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No. The changes only affect CI test configurations.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    - `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`
    - Reviewed the final three-file diff against `upstream/main`.
    - E2E cases require 310P hardware and were not run locally.
    
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/ced6857afa0ea7b2e3f0846a62e1394e90f15607
    
